******************************** Data Format ***********************************

Column 01: Month
Column 02: Hour
Column 03: Frequency (MHz)
Column 04: D - Path distance (km)
Column 05: BMUF - Path basic MUF (MHz)
Column 06: OPMUF - Operation MUF (MHz)
Column 07: OPMUF90 - 90% Operation MUF (MHz)
