Column 09: E - Path Field Strength (dB(1uV/m))
Column 10: Pr - Median receiver power (dB)
Column 11: SNR - Median signal-to-noise ratio (dB)
Column 12: BCR - Basic circuit reliability (%)
Column 13: Dominant mode
Column 14: Dominant mode - Elevation angle (deg)
Column 15: Dominant mode - Delay (mS)
